2. local.settings.json

When running locally, include your Application Insights instrumentation key in your local settings file so that telemetry is captured. Create (or update) the local.settings.json file at the root of your project with content similar to:

---------------------------------------------------------------
{
  "IsEncrypted": false,
  "Values": {
    "AzureWebJobsStorage": "UseDevelopmentStorage=true",
    "FUNCTIONS_WORKER_RUNTIME": "dotnet",
    "APPINSIGHTS_INSTRUMENTATIONKEY": "YOUR_INSTRUMENTATION_KEY_HERE"
  }
}
